1	//! Routine execution engine.
2	//!
3	//! Handles loading routines, checking triggers, enforcing guardrails,
4	//! and executing both lightweight (single LLM call) and full-job routines.
5	//!
6	//! The engine runs two independent loops:
7	//! - A **cron ticker** that polls the DB every N seconds for due cron routines
8	//! - An **event matcher** called synchronously from the agent main loop
9	//!
10	//! Lightweight routines execute inline (single LLM call, no scheduler slot).
11	//! Full-job routines are delegated to the existing `Scheduler`.
