2	//!
3	//! The heartbeat runner executes periodically (default: every 30 minutes) and:
4	//! 1. Reads the HEARTBEAT.md checklist
5	//! 2. Runs an agent turn to process the checklist
6	//! 3. Reports any findings to the configured channel
7	//!
8	//! If nothing needs attention, the agent replies "HEARTBEAT_OK" and no
9	//! message is sent to the user.
10	//!
11	//! # Usage
12	//!
13	//! Create a HEARTBEAT.md in the workspace with a checklist of things to monitor:
14	//!
15	//! ```markdown
16	//! # Heartbeat Checklist
17	//!
18	//! - [ ] Check for unread emails
19	//! - [ ] Review calendar for upcoming events
20	//! - [ ] Check project build status
21	//! ```
